  "changes_data": [
    {
      "diff": "@@ -46,6 +46,11 @@ The following bugs have been fixed:\n \n === New and Updated Features\n \n+* The 'console.log.level' preference was removed in Wireshark 3.6.0. This release adds an '-o console.log.level:' backward-compatibilty option\n+  on the CLI that maps to the new logging sub-system. Note that this does not have bitmask semantics and does not correspond to any actual preference.\n+  It is just a transition mechanism for users that were relying on this CLI option and will be removed in the future. To see the new diagnostic output\n+  options consult the manpages or the output of '--help'.\n+\n // === Removed Features and Support\n \n // === Removed Dissectors\n",
